 [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n6le03ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n6le03ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Mike</b>: Hello Dave. What are you reading?</br>\n<b>Dave</b>: I'm reading an interesting article that might help us with our presentation next week. </br>\n<b>Mike</b>: The one about data migration? What does it say?</br>"}, {"time": "13500", "image": "enpe8n6le03ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Dave</b>: Well. It says \u201cIf you're planning to run a data migration project, you will need to bear in mind some common issues regarding that topic. The most common problems are the complexity of those projects. Different types of storage and files, even different servers make of migration a task of high complexity. Operational dependencies represent a huge issue because IT departments work 24/7, which makes it difficult to meet the conditions to migrate data without outage. Technical dependencies make such projects run slow and increase the cost because some software and hardware need to be updated before the data migration. Scale is also important since large amounts of files make the process take longer than expected. All those factors increase the cost of the project as well. Migration demands a huge investment and sometimes such projects can make people feel tired. However, data migration is something necessary and once it's achieved, it's really satisfying.\u201d</br>"}, {"time": "86500", "image": "enpe8n6le03ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Mike</b>: Wow, data migration might be discouraging and daunting. Anyway, does it mention anything about array-to-array transfer?</br>\n<b>Dave</b>: Yes, it does. To sum up, there are host based, array based, hypervisor based, virtualization appliance based, and virtual array based. The last ones allow seamless data migration.</br>\n<b>Mike</b>: Even though the migration process makes you feel exhausted, it is also fulfilling to know everything works well after such effort. What about file-to-file migration?</br>\n<b>Dave</b>: It only says that if people want to perform file-to-file migration, they will need to understand that it's equally complex. Making data available during and after the migration process without affecting the location or address of the files is something discouraging.</br>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n6le03ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}